sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Agent
    participant S as Sandbox (sandbox.rs)
    participant E as Engine (engine.rs)
    participant I as Isolation (isolation/)
    participant C as Child process
    participant L as AuditLog (audit.rs)

    A->>S: run(argv, cwd, stdin)
    S->>E: decide(Exec)
    E-->>S: Decision {allowed, rule, reason, program, cwd}
    alt denied or dry run
        S->>L: append {request, decision, executed: false}
        S-->>A: RunOutcome (not executed)
    else allowed
        S->>I: prepare(policy, program)
        I-->>S: Seatbelt profile or Landlock ruleset, Enforcement report
        S->>C: spawn: env_clear, process_group(0), pre_exec(setrlimit, landlock_restrict_self)
        par supervision
            S->>C: wall-clock deadline, RSS watchdog (macOS)
        and output
            C-->>S: stdout/stderr readers, capped, kill on overflow
        end
        S->>C: killpg sweep until the group is empty
        S->>L: append {request, decision, outcome summary, enforcement}
        S-->>A: RunOutcome
    end
